  "description": "Hardware-accelerated implementations of TIFF Predictor = 2 (horizontal\n      differencing) and TIFF Predictor = 3 (floating-point predictor, TIFF\n      Technical Note 3) for float32 raster data.  Provides Encode and Decode operations\n      with automatic dispatch to AVX-512BW, AVX2, SSSE3, ARM NEON, or scalar fallback.\n      Designed for use with ZSTD-compressed Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs (COG).",
